# WP-8.4 (SI-001): release-time snapshot artifacts — build-time copies of the
# frozen workspace-root artifacts (8 root docs + schema/ + provenance manifest).
# The canonical frozen copies stay at the workspace root; the plugin repo never
# vendors them (double-source would violate the freeze discipline). Regenerated
# by `pnpm run build` (scripts/snapshot-release.mjs); shipped via the `files`
# surface in every pack.
